---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<img src="/content/cid.png" alt="Consider it done" />
			<p>
			<img src="/blog/content/was.png" alt="With a service that takes care of things for you, so you can focus on what matters." />
			</p>
<h3>About me!</h3>
			<p {float:left}>
				Hello! I’m Zoe, I started this business because I love to help people. From little things like grocery and food orders, to things like projects of all sorts. I want to do it all.

My services and myself are here to fit your needs, I want to make your life easier, and I want you to be able to save your time, and gas for other more important things.


			</p>
<h3>From everyday errands to projects you need a hand with.</h3>
			<p>
				This template comes with a few integrations already configured in your
				<code>astro.config.mjs</code> file. You can customize your setup with
				<a href="https://astro.build/integrations">Astro Integrations</a> to add tools like Tailwind,
				React, or Vue to your project.
			</p>
			<p>Here are a few ideas on how to get started with the template:</p>
			
			<div class="flex container">
			<ul>
				<img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HKqTAt3XEAACcx2?format=jpg&name=tiny">
			    <div class="text-content">
			    	<li>Check out the included blog posts in <code>src/content/blog/</code></li>
			    	<li>Customize the blog post page layout in <code>src/layouts/BlogPost.astro</code></li>
			</ul>
			    </div>
			</div>
			<p>
				Have fun! If you get stuck, remember to <a href="https://docs.astro.build/"
					>read the docs
				</a> or <a href="https://astro.build/chat">join us on Discord</a> to ask questions.
			</p>
			<p>
				Looking for a blog template with a bit more personality? Check out <a
					href="https://github.com/Charca/astro-blog-template"
					>astro-blog-template
				</a> by <a href="https://twitter.com/Charca">Maxi Ferreira</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
</html>
